Curated references and the prioritized idea roadmap. Updated whenever the agent runs a literature
search (see the "Literature search rule" in `docs/charter.md`). Literature ideas are *suggestions* —
they do not override the agent's own hypotheses unless it is stuck.

> Sourcing: prefer the **arXiv** version of each paper (read `ar5iv.org/abs/<id>` HTML or the LaTeX
> source for clean equations; avoid publisher PDFs). When only a PDF exists, convert it with a
> scientific-PDF→markdown tool (`marker` / `nougat` / `docling` / `pymupdf4llm`) and cache the result.

